Hi {Owner},

I build websites for gutter cleaning companies around {City}. {Business Name} has good reviews, but someone whose gutters overflowed in last night's rain can't see a price or book a date without calling.

I built a sample first instead of asking for your time: prices by house size, a twice-a-year plan sign-up, leaf-fall timing for local trees and a before-and-after photo report, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and changes. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth ten minutes on the phone this week?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
